      {
        "id": "wnd7nujmY5hQGDHa",
        "title": "Designing",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>Every lesson has a design section.</p><p>This is where you&#x27;ll start designing a solution to a problem. It probably won&#x27;t be perfect, but each lesson you&#x27;ll make improvements. That&#x27;s how engineers do it - piece by piece!</p>"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "sQbNQCVAKqxwr9fu",
        "title": "Who will your team design for?",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>Read about the different people below, and choose one person who your team will design a specialized bionic arm for.</p>"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "P2GPzf7Hfgn6yyuv",
        "title": "The people you can design for are on a handout!",
        "content": {
          "type": "Drawing",
          "objects": [
